                            <ol className="list-decimal pl-6 text-sm text-indigo-700 mb-4 dark:text-indigo-300 space-y-2">
                                <li>Go to the <a href="https://console.firebase.google.com/" target="_blank" className="text-blue-600 hover:underline dark:text-blue-400">Firebase Console</a> and sign in.</li>
                                <li>Select your existing Firebase project, or create a new one.</li>
                                <li>From the side menu, select "Project settings".</li>
                                <li>On the settings page, scroll down to the "Your apps" section.</li>
