                            * <strong>Blank Version:</strong> A brand new app for standalone use or connecting to a new database.<br/>
                            * <strong>Connected Version:</strong> Updated code containing your current data and connected to your database (suitable for publishing on Google Sites).
                        </p>
                    </div>
